async function stageMedia(records){if(records.beatSound&&hooks?.beatAudio)await hooks.beatAudio.decode(records.beatSound);if(records.background?.mime.startsWith('image/')){const image=await loadImage(records.background,'背景图片');URL.revokeObjectURL(image.url);}return records.cursor?prepareCursor(records.cursor):null;}
async function loadDefaults(){let staged;try{const r=await fetch('assets/web-defaults.json');if(!r.ok)return false;const raw=await r.json(),settings=S.unpack(raw),records=readMedia(raw.media||{});validateRefs(records,raw.mediaRefs||{});if(settings.background.enabled&&settings.background.opacity>0&&settings.background.source==='url'&&settings.background.url)S.effectiveURL(settings.background.url);if(settings.background.enabled&&settings.background.opacity>0&&settings.background.source==='local'&&!records.background)throw Error('默认设置缺少本地背景媒体');if(settings.cursorOverride&&!records.cursor)throw Error('默认设置缺少光标媒体');staged=await stageMedia(records);Object.assign(root.DCProject.DEFAULT_SETTINGS,settings);defaultRecords=records;return true;}catch(e){console.warn('Website defaults unavailable; keeping current defaults:',e.message);return false;}finally{if(staged?.url)URL.revokeObjectURL(staged.url);}}
function theme(p){const el=document.documentElement;el.dataset.theme=p.theme;el.style.setProperty('--playfield-opacity',String((p.playfieldOpacity??100)/100));for(const key of Object.keys(S.COLORS)){if(p.theme==='custom')el.style.setProperty('--'+key,p.customColors[key]);else el.style.removeProperty('--'+key);}for(const key of ['sidebar','topbar','editor','preview'])el.style.setProperty('--panel-opacity-'+key,String((p.panelOpacity?.[key]??70)/100));let shortcut=$('appearanceSettingsShortcut');if(!shortcut){shortcut=document.createElement('button');shortcut.id='appearanceSettingsShortcut';shortcut.type='button';shortcut.textContent='⚙ 网页设置';shortcut.title='顶栏透明时仍可恢复网页设置';shortcut.onclick=()=>open();document.body.append(shortcut);}shortcut.hidden=(p.panelOpacity?.topbar??70)>5;}
function clearURL(which){const url=which==='background'?backgroundURL:cursorURL;if(url)URL.revokeObjectURL(url);if(which==='background')backgroundURL='';else cursorURL='';}
function pointerMove(e){const layer=$('webBackground');if(!layer||layer.hidden||!hooks||hooks.settings().background.mode!=='follow')return;layer.style.setProperty('--wall-x',((e.clientX/innerWidth-.5)*-8)+'%');layer.style.setProperty('--wall-y',((e.clientY/innerHeight-.5)*-8)+'%');}
async function init(h){hooks=h;const values=await Promise.allSettled([h.get('web-background'),h.get('web-cursor'),h.get('web-beatSound')]);backgroundRecord=values[0].status==='fulfilled'?values[0].value:null;cursorRecord=values[1].status==='fulfilled'?values[1].value:null;soundRecord=values[2].status==='fulfilled'?values[2].value:null;const initial={};if(h.fresh)for(const[key,record]of Object.entries(defaultRecords)){initial[key]=record;if(key==='background')backgroundRecord=record;else if(key==='beatSound')soundRecord=record;else cursorRecord=record;}h.beatAudio?.setRecord(soundRecord);if(h.settings().beatSound.type==='custom'&&!soundRecord){h.settings().beatSound.type='moderate';h.toast?.('自定义节拍音未缓存在此浏览器，已使用适中音效');}if(cursorRecord)try{const stage=await prepareCursor(cursorRecord);clearURL('cursor');installCursor(stage);}catch(e){cursorImage=null;cursorPixels=null;clearURL('cursor');h.settings().cursorOverride=false;h.settings().cursorName='';h.toast?.('网页光标缓存无法读取，已使用当前皮肤');}else{clearURL('cursor');cursorImage=cursorPixels=null;cursorSupports=new Map();}const writes=Object.entries(initial).map(([key,record])=>['web-'+key,record]);if(writes.length)try{await h.put(writes);}catch(e){h.toast?.('默认背景或光标暂未缓存，请导出配置备份');}signature='';apply();if(!pointerBound){document.addEventListener('pointermove',pointerMove,{passive:true});pointerBound=true;}}
function apply(){if(!hooks)return;const p=hooks.settings();theme(p);let layer=$('webBackground');if(!layer){layer=document.createElement('div');layer.id='webBackground';layer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');document.body.prepend(layer);}const bg=p.background,visible=bg.enabled&&bg.opacity>0;layer.hidden=!visible;layer.style.opacity=bg.opacity/100;layer.dataset.mode=bg.mode;layer.style.setProperty('--wall-zoom',bg.zoom);const next=JSON.stringify([visible,bg.source,bg.url,bg.type,backgroundRecord?.name,backgroundRecord?.data?.length]);if(next===signature)return;signature=next;generation++;const run=generation;for(const video of layer.querySelectorAll('video')){video.pause();video.removeAttribute('src');video.load();}layer.replaceChildren();clearURL('background');delete layer.dataset.error;if(!visible)return;let url,kind=S.backgroundKind(bg);try{if(bg.source==='local'){if(!backgroundRecord)throw Error('本地背景未缓存，请重新导入');backgroundURL=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([backgroundRecord.data],{type:backgroundRecord.mime}));url=backgroundURL;kind=backgroundRecord.mime.startsWith('video/')?'video':'image';}else{if(!bg.url.trim())return;url=S.effectiveURL(bg.url);}const media=document.createElement(kind==='video'?'video':kind==='page'?'iframe':'img');media.className='wallpaper-media';if(kind==='page'){const same=new URL(url,location.href).origin===location.origin;media.setAttribute('sandbox',same?'allow-scripts':'allow-scripts allow-same-origin');media.setAttribute('referrerpolicy','no-referrer');media.title='网站背景';media.tabIndex=-1;}else if(kind==='video'){media.muted=true;media.loop=true;media.autoplay=true;media.playsInline=true;media.preload='auto';}else media.alt='';media.onerror=()=>{if(run===generation)layer.dataset.error='背景资源无法加载，请在设置中更换 URL 或导入本地文件';};media.src=url;layer.append(media);if(kind==='video')media.play()?.catch(()=>{});}catch(err){layer.dataset.error=err.message;}}
async function fileRecord(file){if(!file||!(/^(image|video)\//.test(file.type)))throw Error('请选择图片或视频文件');return{name:file.name.slice(0,200),mime:file.type,data:new Uint8Array(await file.arrayBuffer())};}
async function commitPreferences(input,records={},refs={},applySettings=hooks.commit){if(mutationRunning)throw Error('正在应用上一份设置，请稍候');mutationRunning=true;let staged=null,writes=[],persisted=false,installed=false;const previousSettings=clone(hooks.settings()),previousBackground=backgroundRecord,previousSound=soundRecord,previousCursor=currentCursor(),messages=[];try{const value=S.normalize(input);validateRefs(records,refs);if(value.background.enabled&&value.background.opacity>0&&value.background.source==='url'&&value.background.url)S.effectiveURL(value.background.url);if(value.background.enabled&&value.background.opacity>0&&value.background.source==='local'&&!records.background&&!matchesRef(backgroundRecord,refs.background))throw Error('配置缺少匹配的本地背景；请导出时勾选“包含本地背景 / 网页光标”，或先导入背景文件');staged=await stageMedia(records);if(value.cursorOverride&&!staged&&(!cursorImage||!matchesRef(cursorRecord,refs.cursor)||value.cursorName&&value.cursorName!==cursorRecord?.name)){value.cursorOverride=false;value.cursorName='';messages.push('未包含匹配的光标图片，已使用当前皮肤');}if(value.beatSound.type==='custom'){const chosen=records.beatSound||soundRecord;if(!chosen||!matchesRef(chosen,refs.beatSound)||value.beatSound.customName&&value.beatSound.customName!==chosen.name){value.beatSound.type='moderate';messages.push('未包含匹配的节拍音文件，已使用适中音效');}else{if(!hooks.beatAudio)throw Error('此浏览器暂不支持音效解码');await hooks.beatAudio.decode(chosen);}}writes=Object.entries(records).map(([key,record])=>['web-'+key,record]);if(writes.length){await hooks.put(writes);persisted=true;}if(records.background)backgroundRecord=records.background;if(records.beatSound)soundRecord=records.beatSound;hooks.beatAudio?.setRecord(soundRecord);if(staged)installCursor(staged);installed=true;signature='';await applySettings(value);apply();if(staged&&previousCursor.url)URL.revokeObjectURL(previousCursor.url);return messages;}catch(error){if(installed){backgroundRecord=previousBackground;soundRecord=previousSound;hooks.beatAudio?.setRecord(soundRecord);installCursor(previousCursor);signature='';try{await applySettings(previousSettings);}catch(restoreError){hooks.toast?.('恢复网页设置失败，请重新加载或导入备份');}}if(persisted)try{await hooks.put(writes.map(([key])=>[key,key==='web-background'?previousBackground:key==='web-beatSound'?previousSound:previousCursor.record]));}catch(restoreError){hooks.toast?.('恢复媒体缓存失败，请重新导入备份');}if(staged?.url)URL.revokeObjectURL(staged.url);if(installed)apply();throw error;}finally{mutationRunning=false;}}
function cursorSupport(size,normal){if(!cursorImage||!cursorPixels?.length)return size[0]/2;const key=[...size,...normal].map(x=>Number(x).toFixed(6)).join(',');if(cursorSupports.has(key))return cursorSupports.get(key);const iw=cursorImage.naturalWidth,ih=cursorImage.naturalHeight,ratio=Math.min(size[0]/iw,size[1]/ih);let max=0;for(const point of cursorPixels)max=Math.max(max,point[0]*iw*ratio*normal[0]+point[1]*ih*ratio*normal[1]);cursorSupports.set(key,max);return max;}
async function previewCursor(record){await commitPreferences({...hooks.settings(),cursorOverride:true,cursorName:record.name||'账号光标'},{cursor:record},{},async value=>{hooks.settings().cursorOverride=value.cursorOverride;hooks.settings().cursorName=value.cursorName;});hooks.changed();hooks.toast('已应用网页单押光标；多押与长条继续使用皮肤的对应贴图，机台装备未修改');}
function drawCursor(c,x,y,w,h,alpha=1){if(!hooks?.settings().cursorOverride||!cursorImage)return false;const iw=cursorImage.naturalWidth||cursorImage.width,ih=cursorImage.naturalHeight||cursorImage.height,ratio=Math.min(w/iw,h/ih);c.save();c.globalAlpha*=alpha;c.drawImage(cursorImage,x-iw*ratio/2,y-ih*ratio/2,iw*ratio,ih*ratio);c.restore();return true;}
